<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <description>Case에서 &quot;Slack 인계 요청&quot; 버튼으로 트리거하는 Screen Flow. 서정비→오도면→강시공 인계 순서를 Slack 채널로 평문 발신(멘션 대상은 평문 이름). 발신은 T5_Send_Slack_Channel_Message subflow 재사용. Case/WO에 쓰기 작업 없음(순수 알림). T5-15 Swarming 전환 시 비활성화/삭제 예정인 임시 폴백. T5-13.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>T5 Case Slack Handoff Request {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>T5 Case Slack Handoff Request</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>Flow</processType>
    <start>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Case</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </start>
    <subflows>
        <name>Send_Handoff_Message</name>
        <label>Slack 인계 알림 발신</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>360</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Done_Screen</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <flowName>T5_Send_Slack_Channel_Message</flowName>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>channelId</name>
            <value>
                <stringValue>C0BTGS2BQLW</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>messageText</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Handoff_Message</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
    </subflows>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Case</name>
        <label>Case 조회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>120</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Confirm_Handoff</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>recordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Case</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>CaseNumber</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Subject</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <screens>
        <name>Confirm_Handoff</name>
        <label>인계 요청 확인</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>240</locationY>
        <allowBack>true</allowBack>
        <allowFinish>true</allowFinish>
        <allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Send_Handoff_Message</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <fields>
            <name>Confirm_Text</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;Case &lt;b&gt;{!Get_Case.CaseNumber}&lt;/b&gt; 를 서정비 → 오도면 → 강시공 순서로 Slack 인계 요청합니다.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;확인을 누르면 인계 채널로 알림이 발신됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter>
        <showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <screens>
        <name>Done_Screen</name>
        <label>발신 완료</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>480</locationY>
        <allowBack>false</allowBack>
        <allowFinish>true</allowFinish>
        <allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <fields>
            <name>Done_Text</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;Slack 인계 알림을 발신했습니다. (서정비 → 오도면 → 강시공)&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter>
        <showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Handoff_Message</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>:handshake: [역할 인계 요청] Case {!Get_Case.CaseNumber}
{!Get_Case.Subject}

인계 순서: @서정비 → @오도면 → @강시공
서정비가 1차 조치 후 오도면(현장 조율)을 거쳐 강시공(시공)으로 인계를 요청합니다.</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <variables>
        <name>recordId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>true</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
